        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="subtitle" value="Every box is a module or file in src/warden (or a script), every arrow a call that exists in the code. The activities sit in the trust zone whose queue runs them (workflows.ZONES); the core zone is the main queue. Dashed yellow: an open pull request, not built yet." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#52606D;fontSize=13;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
